#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A modern, responsive WordPress theme designed specifically for photography portfolios and photo galleries. Features advanced lightbox with EXIF data, WordPress image metadata integration (titles, captions, alt text), fullscreen viewing, WordPress Gallery block enhancement, footer menu support, page template, archive templates for categories/tags, horizontal pagination, reverse geocoding with Google Cloud APIs, deep linking for individual images, social sharing, and responsive design built with Foundation CSS framework."
msgstr ""

